  "purpose": "Japan golf course cluster layer for regional golf climate analysis. This is a practical travel/course-cluster taxonomy, not a prefectural or official administrative classification.",
  "designRules": [
    "Group courses by practical golf travel cluster and course concentration, not only by broad administrative regions.",
    "Each facility maps to exactly one golfClusterId.",
    "A golf cluster will use one representative course/location for regional climate assessment; other courses inherit that assessment.",
    "Do not activate a cluster weather point until a representative course and coordinate pass review.",
    "Keep course facility and selectable course-layout identities separate."
  ],
